/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 141 0 R
/T (However, the practice remains highly controversial due to several ethical and practical concerns. One major issue is the reliability of consent. Patients may be influenced by depression, emotional distress, pain, or feelings of being a burden to others, raising  doubts about whether their decision is fully free and stable over time. Ensuring that consent is truly informed and consistent is therefore a major challenge. )
/E (However, the practice remains highly controversial due to several ethical and practical concerns. One major issue is the reliability of consent. Patients may be influenced by depression, emotional distress, pain, or feelings of being a burden to others, raising  doubts about whether their decision is fully free and stable over time. Ensuring that consent is truly informed and consistent is therefore a major challenge. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
