/Title (Passive euthanasia is defined as the act of letting a patient die naturally by not providing medical treatment that sustains life. Passive euthanasia differs from active euthanasia in that the former does not kill a person, but rather allows an illness or condition to run its course, while the latter involves an action meant to hasten death.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 771 0 R
/Next 775 0 R
>>
