775 0 obj
<<
/Title (Passive euthanasia often arises when a treatment merely prolongs a dying process without prospects for improvement. Examples include disconnecting machines that keep patients breathing, stopping artificial feeding, and not administering CPR \(Do Not Resuscitate orders\).)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 773 0 R
/Next 777 0 R
>>
