/Title (At its heart, voluntary euthanasia revolves around the concept of autonomy, which refers  to the rights of an individual to make decisions about his or her body and personal life. Voluntary euthanasia proponents feel that such decisions must include what happens to  one at the end of his or her life in cases where one cannot avoid suffering and the  inability to regain independence in life.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 791 0 R
/Next 795 0 R
>>
