/Prev 798 0 R
/Next 794 0 R
>>
endobj
797 0 obj
<<
/Title (The question of the adequacy of legal and medical precautions in this procedure is  another point for consideration. While in cases where voluntary euthanasia is legalized, there are tight rules such as several medical opinions, psychological examination, and a terminal condition, among others, the problem is that errors cannot be ruled out even  under these precautions.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 795 0 R
/Next 799 0 R
>>
endobj
