/Title <>
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 834 0 R
/Next 830 0 R
>>
endobj
833 0 obj
<<
/Title (Plus, there are deep social and ideological concerns. Permitting involuntary euthanasia might suggest some lives are deemed worth less by others, leaving out the individuals themselves, who should decide for themselves. This could contribute to discrimination  and reinforce harmful attitudes toward those who are ill, disabled, or dependent. It challenges the fundamental principle that all human lives possess equal worth and  deserve protection.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 831 0 R
/Next 835 0 R
>>
endobj
